        "raw": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">So I was reading a thing somewhere that mentioned a Marvel character named Captain Cosmic. A Wikipedia search turned up nothing... except a local-access variety show that ran in San Fransisco from 1977 to 1980.</span></p><p>It&#39;s... uh. Wow. It was a thing, apparently.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">To anyone who was a kid in the Bay Area in the 70&#39;s, I apologize in advance.</span></p><p>https://youtu.be/M4vJDO5aa4s?t=107</p><p>(Guess there&#39;s no way to embed videos. Smart.)</p><p>That&#39;s the intro and part of an episode, looks like. It&#39;s just this weird thing that relatively few people are likely to have heard about, that suddenly has oblique relevance to something 30 or 40 years on, and I wanted to share it with folks. :B</p>",
