        "created_at": "2018-01-09T10:48:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>To answer your original curiosity: There is a Marvel character who goes by Captain Universe and another character with the real name of Vance Cosmic, but AFAIK not a Captain Cosmic.</p><p>And, hey now, public access TV is the best precisely because it's so weird. (Also I'm biased because I was in a public access TV show based on Star Trek once.)</p>",
